  "pages": 1
 },
 "summary": "A small surface-mount tactile switch with a 5.1 × 5.1 mm body, a 2.0 mm round plunger and four gull-wing terminals. Pressing the plunger closes one normally open contact; terminals A and B are one side of it and C and D the other. The family is ordered by operating force (100, 160 or 260 gf), overall height (1.5 to 5.0 mm) and plunger material (PA46 or brass). TS-1187A-B-A-B is the 160 gf, 1.5 mm, brass-plunger version.",
